# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Railway source data. Local-only, never committed — here or in the web repo
# (Japan-Train-Map), where the builders live.
#
# Official GIS/CSV/GTFS downloads (MLIT N02, data.go.kr, FRA/BTS NARN, the
# state and operator publications behind us-2025/ca-2025), OpenStreetMap
# extracts, and Apple Maps captures remain local under the user's publication
# policy. Source licences and output attribution still apply. This repository ships the processed
# output in app/public/rail/ and app/data/, with per-source provenance recorded
# in app/public/rail/*.sources.md.
#
# The North America fetchers in app/scripts/railway/ take an explicit
# --output-dir. Point it outside the repository; the documented example is
# /private/tmp/na-rail/gtfs.
#
# Never commit raw data, normalized extracts, screenshots, or coordinate-bearing
# reports from these trees.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
app/data/raw/
app/data/.na-rail.lock
app/public/rail/.na-rail.lock
.local/railway-reference-only/

# Source GIS formats, wherever they land.
*.osm
*.osm.pbf
*.osm.xml
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.gpkg

# Station-English scraping inputs and candidate builds: local-only (too large for GitHub)
app/data/station-english-sources/
app/data/station-english-verification-candidates/
app/data/station-english-verification-review/

# Offline North America payloads are preserved locally and in the verified
# draft GitHub backup asset. Git tracks the inventory and restore metadata.
# App inputs and other raw downloads retain the exclusions above.
backups/north-america/2026-10-03/**
!backups/north-america/2026-10-03/README.md
!backups/north-america/2026-10-03/manifest.json
!backups/north-america/2026-10-03/legacy-sources-manifest.json
!backups/north-america/2026-10-03/raw-source-files-manifest.json
!backups/north-america/2026-10-03/storage.json

# The complete offline backup package is kept locally and uploaded separately
# to the user-authorized draft backup; it is not a Git source blob.
/backups/north-america/north-america-2026-10-03.tar.gz

